@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Listar Profesores
GET {{baseUrl}}/professors
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Crear Profesor (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professors
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alan",
  "lastNameP": "Turing",
  "lastNameM": "Mathison",
  "startYear": 2018,
  "cubicle": "Edificio T - Cubículo 104"
}

### Registrar Grado Académico / Estudio (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professors/PROFESSOR_UUID_HERE/studies
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "degree": "Doctorado",
  "title": "Doctor en Ciencias de la Computación",
  "institution": "Universidad de Cambridge",
  "year": 1938
}

### Registrar Publicación (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professors/PROFESSOR_UUID_HERE/publications
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "On Computable Numbers, with an Application to the Entscheidungsproblem",
  "year": 1936,
  "doi": "10.1112/plms/s2-42.1.230"
}

